Package: poe-fan-hat-oled
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), adduser, ${misc:Depends}
Description: status display for the Seengreat PoE Fan HAT (C) OLED
 Drives the 0.87" 128x32 SSD1316 OLED on the Seengreat PoE Fan HAT (C) for
 the Raspberry Pi 5 over /dev/i2c-1. Shows hostname, uptime, management IPv4,
 CPU temperature, fan rpm and the current throttle flags.
 .
 Standard library only, no network access (IPAddressDeny=any), runs as a
 dynamic user with device access limited to i2c and the firmware mailbox
 (/dev/vcio). Settings in /etc/default/poe-fan-hat-oled.
